1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,000
We don't delete Black Friday pages.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,000
We keep them.

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:07,000
Most stores do the same thing, every December.

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:09,000
Sale ends.

5
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:10,000
Page deleted.

6
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,000
Rebuilt in November.

7
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:15,000
But a seasonal page needs three things.

8
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:18,000
One URL. No year in it.

9
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:21,000
A holding message, after the sale.

10
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:24,000
A refresh, every October.

11
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,000
Without those three, every single year starts at zero.

12
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,000
The page sleeps.

13
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:31,000
The authority doesn't.

14
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,000
